<title>GREECE: Attica Enterprises profits up 42 pct.</title>
<headline>Attica Enterprises profits up 42 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greek shipper Attica Enterprises said in a statement that its net income rose 42.1 percent year-on-year to 3.710 billion drachmas in the first nine months of 1996 and its sales surged 81.2 percent to 10.9 billion.</p>
</text>
